<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia confirms tender for 100,000 tonnes durum.</title>
<headline>Tunisia confirms tender for 100,000 tonnes durum.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia confirmed it was tendering on Thursday for the purchase of four lots of 25,000 tonnes each of durum wheat.</p>
<p>The state's buying body, Office des Cereales, said shipment dates were March 20-31, April 10-20, May 1-10, and May 20-31.</p>
